WEBVTT

NOTE Descriptive captions: the video has no voice, only music and on-screen text.

00:00.000 --> 00:02.000
[Music] Words flash by: "Search." "Stream."

00:02.000 --> 00:04.000
A wave in the brand colours writes: "Music that moves you."

00:04.000 --> 00:06.500
wavelet logo. The phone shows the app's home screen: "Every track, one tap away."

00:06.500 --> 00:10.500
Searching "daft punk": the artist as top result, then the album Random Access Memories. "Search all of Deezer."

00:10.500 --> 00:14.000
Now playing, the lyrics light up as they're sung: "Full tracks. Lyrics in sync."

00:14.000 --> 00:18.000
New in 1.5: the album downloads with a wavy progress ring, then Library › Downloads: 13 tracks, 68.4 MB on device. "Take it offline."

00:18.000 --> 00:21.000
The phone and the web version side by side: "Android." "Web." "Your music."

00:21.000 --> 00:24.000
wavelet logo: "Music that moves you. On Android and the web. On your own server." v1.5 · Android · Web.
